{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:862ddc9a512fdd2e0c8d52261d5de82db4276bff692d595f1806f8fd8e784203",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9707b4c9b79063dc9f6b2cd6df8058e70d7674ee867db77253ebce19b2eb7b4",
      "text": "那、那是因为……做不到喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e95fee33422660a9409082ffaa63224e7f9c137711524517b71bef24eaccbd",
      "text": "一看着●●●●プロデューサー君……\n表情或动作的一点点微小变化都会好在意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2492b0809ca21390d5ec95d262cf8a78890be21f2f96929d55dce2dd17c7e70",
      "text": "坐立不安～心痒难耐～……\n不知为何，脑子和身体都静不下来喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff6d75dd282dc7e5c4d888e79307906f12bb495453f1ae2eae4a2744f65c81c2",
      "text": "啊啊，是这么回事啊。\n行了行了，那你去泡壶茶过来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a77274d09674de5f14fbcead6ba8bec783cc02ad31241623feaa8b792299aaa",
      "text": "喵喵。交给我吧喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c673029c8ed6ffa80f0f9ccb2388ecb30e7f947eebbfab94d7f3fc897d2227bc",
      "text": "桐生先生怎么了呢。\n刚才确实一直静不下心的样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c02e7539808706001e90c29ec73a117739101e00a228726a02c90f42d7860ea",
      "text": "那家伙啊，是在担心\n你到底有没有待得开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acdc244b1e441809eb38d8d9b6349e2cd0d278a7a0ca38d232747cf20b25353c",
      "text": "不是脑子也不是身体，而是心在坐立难安。\n但因为不习惯这种感觉，所以陷入混乱了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b1f1aecca7193882b651096f592c9fb0f9e47462e95236fb75926d57564a0a7",
      "text": "且不论落语的说功和才能……但在你那里，\n那家伙或许也变得稍微有些感情丰富起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bf152df156f63caed2971d92c535b9887af8b9661b8e1e6de1b5f4301e15bcb",
      "text": "两位久等了，茶泡好啦喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
